    "video_with_text_pXncdW": {
      "type": "video-with-text",
      "blocks": {
        "heading_7cniVU": {
          "type": "heading",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Ease <strong>Neck Pain </strong>at Home &nbsp;",
            "heading_size": "title-sm",
            "heading_tag": "h2",
            "highlighted_text": "none",
            "highlighted_scribble": "circle",
            "highlighted_reveal": false
          }
        },
        "text_FLhwYT": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Years of hard work, prolonged sitting and bad posture put damaging tension on the cervical spine... This causes the cervical discs to <strong>squeeze out of place and put pressure on the nearby nerves</strong>, leading to that grinding pain...</p><p>Laying down on the Mendable Cradle for <span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">just 10 minutes a day</span> progressively <strong>improves blood circulation, relaxes tight muscles..</strong></p>",
            "text_font": "body",
            "text_size": "subtext-sm",
            "text_max_size": 32,
            "text_line_height": 1.6,
            "text_letter_spacing": 0,
            "text_capitalize": false,
            "secondary_color": false,
            "highlighted_text": "none",
            "highlighted_scribble": "circle"
